"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, start a fresh NEW save.\n\nOnce you have created a new save, press 'ENTER' or '/', then, type '/connect archipelago.gg:XXXXX [slotname]'\n\nXXXXX is the room’s port. You can find this number on the website after creating a new room.\n\n'[slotname]' is the name assigned to your yaml file.\n\nYou can also type the password at the end (after the slot name if the host set one).\n\nFinally, press enter and you should see a few messages appear on the right-side of your screen saying that you're connected or, that there was an error.",
